{"At midnight, the server crashed. Find clues and solve the mystery.": "assets/audio/00.m4a", "What happened at midnight?": "assets/audio/01.m4a", "When did the server crash?": "assets/audio/02.m4a", "Where were the players?": "assets/audio/03.m4a", "PLAYER: \u201cI could not move or log out.\u201d": "assets/audio/04.m4a", "STREAMER: \u201cEverything was fine at 11:58 p.m.\u201d": "assets/audio/05.m4a", "DEVELOPER: \u201cWe posted a message.\u201d": "assets/audio/06.m4a", "At 11:58 p.m. the game worked.": "assets/audio/07.m4a", "A hacker caused the crash.": "assets/audio/08.m4a", "The server returned after three hours.": "assets/audio/09.m4a", "The developers planned the crash.": "assets/audio/10.m4a", "I think the server crashed because too many players joined.": "assets/audio/11.m4a", "Mission complete. Great work, detective!": "assets/audio/12.m4a"}